## the atomic renames; the `.exe` names are the GitHub asset names, droppable at
## the repo root so that `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt` works in place
## (make_release_zip.py excludes the same names from the source snapshot).
KimiPlanbarTray-*.zip*
KimiPlanbarTray-*.exe
SHA256SUMS.txt*
